  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "the hands",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": [
              "cat_-8",
              "cat_-5",
              "cat_3",
              "cat_5",
              "cat_8",
              "cat_11",
              "cat_15",
              "rabbit",
              "dog"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "removed_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand[min(int(uniform(0, len(you.hand))), len(you.hand) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.removed_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_mice"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "cat_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_cat_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "start_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "start_seat_round_1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "first_k",
            "value": {
              "calc": "first_reveal_with_3_players if len(players) == 3 else first_reveal_with_4_or_5_players"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "removed_card",
        "mice",
        "cat_points"
      ],
      "text": "You start with (removed_card is the card taken out of your hand, known only to you):"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "a new round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "start_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((round - 1) % len(players)) + start_seat_round_1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "stayed",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(['STAY'] if you.mice >= min_mice_to_stay else []) + ['DROP']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "shuffled",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stayer_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_value",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} of {rounds} begins. Start player: seat {start_seat}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "sack",
      "label": "fill the sack",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "hand"
        }
      },
      "store": "placed_card",
      "text": "Secretly choose one card from your hand to put into the sack. It never comes back. Nobody will learn which card you placed."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "sack",
      "label": "cards into the sack",
      "do": [
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.placed_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.placed_card for p in players]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Every card is in the sack."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "sack",
      "label": "shuffle the sack",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack[min(int(uniform(0, len(sack))), len(sack) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "shuffled",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack[min(int(uniform(0, len(sack))), len(sack) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "shuffled",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack[min(int(uniform(0, len(sack))), len(sack) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "shuffled",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack[min(int(uniform(0, len(sack))), len(sack) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "shuffled",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack[min(int(uniform(0, len(sack))), len(sack) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "shuffled",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(sack) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": {
              "calc": "shuffled"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "shuffled",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The sack is shuffled."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "first reveal",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[sack[0]] + ([sack[1]] if first_k >= 2 else [])"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "First reveal (owners unknown): {revealed_cards}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "talk",
      "label": "talk",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 30
      },
      "store": "message",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} says: {value}"
      },
      "text": "Write one short message to the table. Everyone writes at the same time; all messages are shown once they are in. Claims are not binding and may be lies."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "stay",
      "label": "stay or drop",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "store": "stay_choice",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} chooses {value}."
      },
      "text": "Choose STAY or DROP. STAY: pay {stay_fee} mouse now (never refunded, even if you lose) and bid for the sack. DROP: receive {drop_payment} mice and sit out the rest of this round. With fewer than {min_mice_to_stay} mice you may only DROP."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stay",
      "label": "entry and drop payment",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "stayed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.stay_choice == 'STAY'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stayer_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.stay_choice == 'STAY' for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.stay_choice == 'STAY'"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-stay_fee"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} stays and pays the fee."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.stay_choice != 'STAY'"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "drop_payment"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} drops and receives mice."
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "{stayer_count} player(s) stayed."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "second reveal",
      "do": [
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "revealed_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack[first_k]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Second reveal. Sack cards shown so far: {revealed_cards}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "sealed bid",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.stayed"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "min_bid"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.mice"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} bids {value}."
      },
      "text": "Secretly bid a whole number of mice, from {min_bid} up to your current mice. The highest bid wins the sack; on a tie the tied player with fewer mice wins, then the first in seat order from the start player. Only the winner pays the bid."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "the winner",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_key",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid * 100000 - p.mice * 100 - ((p.seat - start_seat + len(players)) % len(players)) for p in players if p.stayed])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "stayer_count > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.stayed and p.bid * 100000 - p.mice * 100 - ((p.seat - start_seat + len(players)) % len(players)) == best_key])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "stayer_count > 0"
            },
            "text": "Seat {winner_seat} wins the sack."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": 0,
            "if": {
              "calc": "stayer_count == 0"
            },
            "text": "Nobody stayed. Nobody wins the sack."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "sack value",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "cat_vals",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[cat_value_1 if c == 'cat_-8' else cat_value_2 if c == 'cat_-5' else cat_value_3 if c == 'cat_3' else cat_value_4 if c == 'cat_5' else cat_value_5 if c == 'cat_8' else cat_value_6 if c == 'cat_11' else cat_value_7 for c in sack if c != 'rabbit' and c != 'dog']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum(cat_vals) + rabbit_value * count(c == 'rabbit' for c in sack) + dog_value * count(c == 'dog' for c in sack) - (max(cat_vals + [-1000]) if (count(c == 'dog' for c in sack) == dogs_that_cancel_top_cat and len(cat_vals) > 0) else 0)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The whole sack: {revealed_cards}. Sack value: {sack_value}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "payment",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-you.bid"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} pays their bid."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "cat_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack_value"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} adds {sack_value} to their cat points."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "discard",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard + sack"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Sack cards discarded face up. Discard: {discard}. Standings [seat, mice, cat points]: {[[p.seat, p.mice, p.cat_points] for p in players]}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "end check",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "(you.mice + you.cat_points) * 1000 + you.cat_points",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final [seat, total, cat points, mice]: {[[p.seat, p.mice + p.cat_points, p.cat_points, p.mice] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 8,
    "rounds_max": 10,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "SETUP. Every player receives the same {cards_per_hand} cards: cats worth {cat_value_1}, {cat_value_2}, {cat_value_3}, {cat_value_4}, {cat_value_5}, {cat_value_6} and {cat_value_7}, one Rabbit worth {rabbit_value}, and one Dog worth {dog_value}. {cards_removed_per_hand} card is removed at random from each hand. Its owner is told which card it is. No one else is told. Each player starts with {starting_mice} mice and {starting_cat_points} cat points. The bank of mice is unlimited. Seat {start_seat_round_1} is the start player in round 1. The game lasts {rounds} rounds, so every remaining card is played.\n\nEACH ROUND\n1. Start player. In round 1 it is seat 1. In each later round it is the next seat in order. The start player matters only for breaking ties.\n2. Fill the sack. All players at the same time secretly choose one card from their hand and place it in the sack. Placed cards never return.\n3. Shuffle. The sack is shuffled into a random order.\n4. First reveal. Cards are shown from the front of the shuffled order. With 3 players, {first_reveal_with_3_players} card is shown. With 4 or 5 players, {first_reveal_with_4_or_5_players} cards are shown. Revealed cards do not say who placed them.\n5. Talk. Every player writes one short message at the same time, without seeing the others' messages. All messages are then shown. Claims are not binding and may be lies.\n6. Stay or drop. All players at the same time choose STAY or DROP. A player with fewer than {min_mice_to_stay} mice must DROP.\n7. Entry and drop payment. Each player who chose STAY pays {stay_fee} mouse to the bank immediately. This fee is never refunded, whether or not they win. Each player who chose DROP receives {drop_payment} mice from the bank and is out for this round: they do not bid and cannot win the sack.\n8. Second reveal. The next {second_reveal_count} card in the shuffled order is shown to everyone.\n9. Sealed bid. Every player who chose STAY secretly bids a whole number of mice, from {min_bid} up to their current mice (counted after paying the fee). All bids are revealed together.\n10. Winner. The highest bidder wins the sack. If two or more players tie for the highest bid, the tied player with fewer current mice wins. If they are still tied, the tied player who comes first in seat order, counting from the start player, wins. If nobody stayed, nobody wins, no bid is paid and the sack is discarded. If exactly one player stayed, that player wins and pays their bid.\n11. Sack value. All remaining sack cards are revealed. The sack's value is the sum of the cats in it. The Rabbit and Dogs are worth 0. If exactly {dogs_that_cancel_top_cat} Dog is in the sack and the sack holds at least one cat, the cat with the highest value is removed before summing. Two or more Dogs have no effect.\n12. Payment. The winner pays their bid to the bank and adds the sack's value to their cat points. The value may be negative.\n13. Losing stayers receive nothing and pay no bid. They have already paid their fee.\n14. Discard. All sack cards are discarded face up, so everyone can count which cards have been used.\n15. End check. After round {rounds} the game ends.\n\nSCORING. Each player's total is their cat points plus their mice. The player with the highest total wins. If totals are tied, the tied player with the most cat points wins. If that is also tied, those players share the win."
}
